    "detailed_description": "It's a full opportunity to experience being a raver through their eyes. Apart from the fun side of it, its challenges are also very important.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Imagine experiencing survival elements in a casual life outside of normal survival games.<br></li><li>Human interaction is very important for the network you will create.<br></li><li>Dance. To be the best raver you have to dance the best, extraordinary dance mechanics.<br></li><li>And the worst addictions. the opportunity to experience surviving despite them and either living with them or letting them go. it's your choice.</li></ul>Welcome to the world of ravers. Even though you are no longer one of us, you are like us.",
